---
manual: art.arc
lines: [1665, 1670]
testability: visual
display: native
ledger: E12
----------- app code
# An ext pin: Shoes 4's arc takes wedge: true for a pie slice filled to the centre
# (DESIGN 12). Without it an arc fills as a chord.
Shoes.app width: 320, height: 180 do
  nostroke
  fill red
  @pie = arc 20, 20, 140, 140, 0, Math::PI / 2, wedge: true
  @chord = arc 170, 20, 140, 140, 0, Math::PI / 2
end
----------- test code
# Each arc's quarter runs from 3 o'clock to 6 o'clock about its box's centre. A point just
# below and right of the centre is inside the pie and outside the chord.
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(95, 95).first(3), "the wedge is filled to the centre"
assert_equal [255, 255, 255], pixel_at(245, 95).first(3), "the chord is not"
assert_equal [255, 0, 0], pixel_at(282, 132).first(3), "both fill along the curve"
